Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.58,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.40,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.16,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,hey, there will not feel it alive,\Nlook out below, wake up sunshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.94,0:00:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high,\Nhail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.70,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky, time\Nto journey on, on your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.12,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.08,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.38,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.84,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad just at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on the wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing. Feel it's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.36,0:01:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling\Nalive, look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.40,0:02:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.58,0:02:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.94,0:02:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.78,0:02:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.10,0:02:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Baratie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.70,0:02:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything you're\Nneglecting to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.78,0:02:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you received a reply from\NPrincess Shirahoshi yet? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.10,0:02:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Captain Deccan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.02,0:02:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still no work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how long has she kept me waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, about ten years or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.62,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,She's really taking her time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.82,0:03:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the doing of\Nthat despicable Neptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He intends to force the princess\Ninto a political marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.72,0:03:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or so I suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten years now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.62,0:03:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That heartless monarch\Nhas kept his daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,locked in a steel tower\Nfor an entire decade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.84,0:03:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how it pains me so!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.60,0:03:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This cruel tragedy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess and I are in love! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I suspect,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how far I search\Nalong this vast sea floor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.16,0:03:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never find another as big\Nand beautiful as you, my dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.68,0:03:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We are meant to be together. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.89,0:03:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll twist the head of fate itself to\Nprevent you from being with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.76,0:03:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather see you dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You can live as my wife\Nor stop living altogether.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me give you another token of my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,An axe with a rose on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Accept this emblem of my\Ndeadly and dying love.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.68,0:04:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, isn't that the wrong direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.12,0:04:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I never miss my target!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.38,0:04:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In reverse course!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.98,0:04:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And look, it's heading straight\Ntowards the rear new palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.82,0:04:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha ha ha ha ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.86,0:04:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hungry pirate looking\Nfor something to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.32,0:04:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My ears!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Hero, she's crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the hard shell tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, but where the hell\Nare the on-duty guards?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:04:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.27,0:04:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's nobody protecting her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.14,0:05:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.46,0:05:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The guards are in the\Nmiddle of changing shifts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.40,0:05:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No excuses! To the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.78,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.88,0:05:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a human here in my chambers!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A bloodthirsty human aiming\Nto kill me, I'm certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? No! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.64,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go make this stuff up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted that food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.44,0:05:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know you\Nwere in here, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.96,0:05:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's throwing axes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.50,0:05:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.96,0:05:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you injured somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You were crying even louder than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It gave us quite the fright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.68,0:06:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pull me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.60,0:06:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, the door was already open.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see any intruders here, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.86,0:06:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps a strong current opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.14,0:06:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I woke crying from a\Nbad dream, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I just heard someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.14,0:06:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have some rather dire and vexing\Ninformation I must relay to you immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's regarding the pirate who saved\Nmegalo the one known as Straw Hat luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Some mermaid girls were kidnapped\Nand he's our prime suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.86,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, based on a troubling\Nprediction from madam charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,the Straw Hat crew is considered a\Npotential risk for the entire kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.64,0:06:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So we've locked them in the\Npalace prison just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:07:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We already have the swordsman in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Upon arrival, he drank himself\Ninto a state of compliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Three other members of the\Ncrew have? just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And I imagine they're in\Ncustody as well by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But their captain,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,well, he might be more perceptive than he\Nappears and picked up on our intentions,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.00,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,for he seems to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.88,0:07:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,have fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,He is almost certainly hiding somewhere\Nin the palace, so please be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll catch the rest of them\Non the island in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.72,0:07:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can promise you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We will defend
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,this country as well as\Nyour home at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.54,0:07:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what I wanted to\Nsay, I feel awful that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to arrest the\Npeople who saved Megalow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how much he means to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Five minutes
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we'll be going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.12,0:07:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.62,0:07:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.32,0:07:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.52,0:08:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have given you a chance earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll forgive me if I\Nhad only known who you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.20,0:08:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That you were the one who saved\NMegalo. Not to be overly familiar,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,but may I call you Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.16,0:08:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure So, Luffy, they said\Nthat you're a pirate, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.14,0:08:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you're a bad person?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.52,0:08:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll let you make that call. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.34,0:08:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know if you just heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But our soldiers have taken\Nyour friends into custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.20,0:08:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.32,0:08:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.34,0:08:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way your guys can\Nkeep them locked up for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Huh. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.40,0:08:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's with the axe? Let me hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.94,0:08:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know who threw the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.32,0:08:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Were they trying to hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.24,0:08:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who threw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And yes, he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.90,0:08:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Vander\NDecken, and he's a pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.06,0:08:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He wanted to marry me, and I refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So he wants to kill me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.08,0:09:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.82,0:09:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, he ate the Mark Mark\Nfruit and he used that power to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,mark me all he has to do is\Nthrow a weapon and it will find
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,me that's why I never leave\Nhere. My only real chance to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,continue living is being locked\Naway inside the hardshell tower
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So this creep wants to\Nmarry you but he's trying
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.28,0:09:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,To kill you. Yes, I've\Nbeen in here 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,10 whole years?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you must be bored. Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And my father made a well-meaning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but misguided rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, no one can visit\Nfor more than 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.34,0:09:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why, Megalo's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.28,0:09:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,my only real friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.72,0:09:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Without him, well, I wouldn't\Nhave anyone to talk to. Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.66,0:09:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,they were gonna Throw\Na big banquet to thank
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,us for saving him that's\Nbeen cancelled now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe they were just worried you would\Nconsume the entire kingdom's food supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.64,0:10:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You humans sure do eat a lot despite how\Nsmall you are that's the old guy's fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.64,0:10:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He made a big fuss about the banquet\Nwhen then he kept getting yelled at.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.30,0:10:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally couldn't wait any longer,\Nso I followed the smell here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.06,0:10:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, by the way, did they\Ncall you princess? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.86,0:10:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're the mermaid princess? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.80,0:10:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That does come with being\NKing Neptune's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.84,0:10:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.86,0:10:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.64,0:10:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's too tough to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I'm eating that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.78,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I could be wrong, but you\Nhaven't struck me as a bad person so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.04,0:10:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an adventurer?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.72,0:10:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you decided\Nto become a pirate?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.22,0:10:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you must have seen the sun\Nmany times in your adventures.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and what do the stars\Nin the night sky look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I bet you've seen\Nall sorts of animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.82,0:11:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And flowers too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.12,0:11:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what else? Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever been to the green place?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I think perhaps people call it a forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.78,0:11:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You ask too many questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.56,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cute how full your cheeks are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.42,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.33,0:11:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't yell at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.18,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.12,0:11:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a... brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.64,0:11:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing to cry over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever yelled at me before,\Nand I don't like it. It's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.58,0:11:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How can someone so big be\Nsuch a coward and a crybaby?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.72,0:12:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I don't think I like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.56,0:12:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's ever said such\Nan awful thing to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a terrible man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.44,0:12:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, just go, I want you to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.26,0:12:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.76,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It hurts too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I am full!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the grub!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.72,0:12:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,With as long as you've been stuck in here,\Nno wonder you're scared of everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.70,0:12:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just please get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.62,0:12:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I could, but isn't there some\Nplace that you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, of course there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.22,0:12:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There are lots of places\Nthat I'd love to see. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.68,0:12:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So, let's get out of here. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.00,0:12:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go take a stroll. No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.30,0:12:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.88,0:12:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that! Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.86,0:13:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If that guy throws something at you, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it down just like the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's up, Chin? Nani-Chin? Brooke-Chin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.84,0:13:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Apprehend them now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just three, me three, humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you've got to stop resisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You really will be\Ncriminals if you don't! Yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no just cause\Nfor them to lock us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.48,0:13:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.60,0:13:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is such a total letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.66,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wanted that banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.52,0:13:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,At this point, playing\Nnice won't do much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.76,0:13:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.20,0:13:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They've made up their minds\Nabout what kind of people we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.02,0:13:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,If they desire, we'll stay and\Nfight them till the end of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely the three of\Nthem aren't that strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be bluffing. Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No one knows what the future holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,So whether we're heroes or villains,\Nyou still shouldn't cross us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:14:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it me, or has he really\Ngotten his act together? See?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a very prologue to the\Nfuture that's been foreseen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.28,0:14:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have fought back in the first
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.50,0:14:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,place if you guys didn't\Ninsist on fighting us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.66,0:14:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, good point. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.08,0:14:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not compared to the giant\Ninsect attack I went
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.46,0:14:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,through back when I was\Non the Bowen Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.98,0:14:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My new weapon, Black Cabotol! Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to give you a demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.38,0:14:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep that tune!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.32,0:14:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We need your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.00,0:14:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it really fair to\Narrest someone based on
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,a prediction that they\Nwill commit a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.06,0:14:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I need time to contemplate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a precarious situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And until I decide, you will\Nhave to wait in custody!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.40,0:14:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Please fight for a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.50,0:15:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought they locked you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounded like you guys were\Nhaving some fun, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait for me there, Waratsumi. Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.32,0:15:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Red Deacon's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.96,0:15:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd come!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.52,0:15:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome. Sorry to keep\Nyou gentlemen waiting. We
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,ran into a bit of a\Nvolcanic eruption a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And you must be the notorious 40 i
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.08,0:15:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,suspect enough flattery you're notorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.64,0:15:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We both are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.16,0:15:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Naughty Vanderdecken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.56,0:15:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Pleasure to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.96,0:15:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A formal handshake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.86,0:15:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.18,0:15:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a bit tricky for a fellow like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.74,0:15:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.70,0:16:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.94,0:16:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.34,0:16:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.40,0:16:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.86,0:16:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Heart Jones
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing on the seafloor can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.04,0:16:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst of the worst together, at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.84,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune is a royal nuisance,\Nfor you and I alike, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.32,0:16:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, we got the same goal here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.30,0:16:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His army, they take no\Npride in being fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So together, we will conquer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.02,0:16:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And then we kill Neptune, god of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.24,0:16:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And lastly, we will destroy\Nthe entire Ryugu kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.84,0:17:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you guys done?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.44,0:17:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is overkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not bad guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We were just doing their jobs!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to be so rough!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you forgot, it was you\Nguys who started this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All I did was save you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.72,0:17:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We would have been fine if we just\Nacted tough and then ran for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To think I gave up sightseeing and\Nshopping on the island to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the point of even\Ncomplaining about it anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like we could take it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The point is, it shouldn't have happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We look like villains now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna believe\Nwe took a trip to Fishman
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Island and just happened\Nto seize their palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you prefer we let\Nourselves get captured?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.52,0:17:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer if we'd gone with\Nmy runaway plan, like I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.46,0:17:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Which wouldn't have worked,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.37,0:17:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,because I don't know how to get out\Nof here, and Luffy's still missing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.06,0:17:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a really good point\Nthat I hadn't thought about!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Any idea where Luffy went? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.88,0:17:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We really have to go, so could\Nyou help us out, pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.60,0:17:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he can tell you where to find Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.82,0:17:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where I can\Nfind the treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.62,0:17:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:17:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play innocent with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I don't know how\Nyour greedy brain works?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, everybody, let's take a little\Nbreak and turn those frowns upside down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,With rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.56,0:18:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be all right. No reason to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.90,0:18:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Words of mine aren't lies, everybody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You are helping the situation, So King!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.42,0:18:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeling any\Nbetter now, your highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe that even the great knight\Nof the sea was bested by these mongrels.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.38,0:18:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Things would have been different if I\Nhadn't thrown my back out all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.98,0:18:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when I became so old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.60,0:18:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.18,0:18:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If we had gathered our wits sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we could have burst their\Nbubbles and won easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.80,0:18:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that they've drained the water\Nfrom the room, it's hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.82,0:18:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And who will rescue us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you criminals!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time\Nbefore Neptune's sons Fukaboshi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoboshi, and Manboshi\Nreturn to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:19:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And once they get here,\Nyou're all going to be sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo-ho-ho-ho! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter who's coming, we\Nhave to make it off this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our first step should be\Ngetting everyone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we find the sunny and\Nget the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But we lost our coding when we got\Nhere, so even if we knew where it was,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,we couldn't escape on it as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.54,0:19:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To top it all off, the log\Npose hasn't been working.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.42,0:19:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been going haywire ever\Nsince we arrived on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.02,0:19:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you believe a primitive pose like\Nthat will get you through the new world,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.70,0:19:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're even dumber\Nthan you look. Wait,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.66,0:19:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,are you trying to say that\Nmy gear isn't good enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.14,0:19:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying anything\Nunless you untie me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.84,0:19:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be Prince Fukaboshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.48,0:19:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.40,0:19:54.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What could be delaying\Nthe guards from answering?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.66,0:19:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.54,0:20:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang up, Prince Fukaboshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.68,0:20:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Ryuboshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.90,0:20:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Maboshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.60,0:20:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Something's wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.58,0:20:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hear them call for Merde!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.18,0:20:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like they're in trouble,\Nbut I didn't hear Father Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.94,0:20:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's us, the three\Nprinces. What has happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,With whom am I currently speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the gate and grant us passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That is an order from the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm really shaking in my boots here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, you're not coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.80,0:20:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, how about we just hang up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.12,0:20:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to make them angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do Kuma and me a favor and tie us\Nup so we don't look like your accomplices?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.58,0:20:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.32,0:20:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So tell me, are you a member\Nof the Straw Hat Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He is, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The man you are speaking to is their\Ngreen-haired swordsman, Pirate Hunter Saru.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.67,0:20:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.59,0:20:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.46,0:20:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for now, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:21:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you want him and the\Nothers to stay like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to have to\Nrun some errands for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You can start by getting us\Nready to sail out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.26,0:21:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What that means is finding our ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.36,0:21:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,the Sunny, and getting a fresh\Nnew coating slapped on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.12,0:21:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And I mean finding, because we\Ngot no clue where it is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,While you're at it, round up our crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.98,0:21:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're missing a gloomy lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.54,0:21:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,a big robot thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,talking raccoon and a\Nlittle goblin pervert and
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,demands one million berries\Nand unmarked cash you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,stop spurring him on\Nthe goblin isanji that's
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.44,0:21:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,hilarious sorrow you are\Nnot helping at all brook
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. I accept your conditions.\NI will make the proper
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.70,0:21:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,arrangements for you and your\Nfriends to leave fishman island you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,have my word however i will\Ndismiss our contract if any of
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.22,0:21:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The hostages are harmed. It's\Na deal, but brother, we have no
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,choice but to agree as you\Nare aware this gateway is the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.88,0:21:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,only means of entering ryugu\Npalace even for us of the royal
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.80,0:22:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,family while we could try to\Ngain access from another area
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,there is simply no way for us to\Npenetrate the layers of bubbles
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something i must say before we go\Ni wouldn't normally share this information
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.46,0:22:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,given the circumstances however i am honor\Nbound to deliver the message regardless
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.32,0:22:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm listening. They are from the first son\Nof the sea and former warlord Jinbe for
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.00,0:22:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat luffy these were meant to be\Ndelivered upon your arrival on the island
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.70,0:22:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,as part of your welcoming but here we are
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.16,0:22:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe but why and how do they know Jinbe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait that's right. Yeah, Luffy said Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,was his friend true the two of them even
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.72,0:22:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,appeared together in the newspaper a\Nwhile back despite being a pirate jimbe is
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,almost like a hero to the people down here\Nunfortunately luffy isn't with us right
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.64,0:22:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,at this moment but i'll pass the messages
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.86,0:23:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,on go you would have my thanks the first
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.28,0:23:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is do not fight and as\Nfor the second Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.18,0:23:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,will wait in the sea forest that is all
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.78,0:23:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,don't fight Heart what does\Nthat even mean have you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.80,0:23:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,heard the rumors going around\Nthe ones about the straw
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.46,0:23:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,hat pirates it's crazy\Nyou think they really took
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,over yugu palace what is it\Nthey're after anyway that
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.02,0:23:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,can't be i met them they\Nseem like such nice people
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.12,0:23:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't believe they do\Nsuch a thing i bet they did
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.42,0:23:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,kidnap those mermaids and\Nthe way things are going it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,won't be long before they\Ncome after the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.28,0:23:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam Charlie's vision is coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.56,0:23:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess they're finally\Nshowing their true colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that two of them have been hiding
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.82,0:23:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,around here in the back\Nof the Mermaid Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.96,0:23:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why the guards are\Ninspecting it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for Kong Fu Point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.50,0:24:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's finally recovering.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.16,0:24:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs peace and quiet at any cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.06,0:24:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to take us to\Nthe Ryugu Palace, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.76,0:24:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's happening\Nhere, but we're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.80,0:24:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.46,0:24:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji, you shouldn't be up and about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.96,0:24:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to bed. No fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.26,0:24:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.54,0:24:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to ask them\Nsomething about the Ryugu Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.82,0:24:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.20,0:24:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The mermaid princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.90,0:24:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's there. So what? I'll\Ngo. It's worth it. Oh, it isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.18,0:24:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still too weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.72,0:24:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's beautiful,\Nyou might die! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.76,0:24:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ready yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.24,0:24:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.28,0:24:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, though I'd like to. Then why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.80,0:24:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there was somewhere\Nyou wanted to see, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.44,0:24:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I did, but if I leave my room,\Nit'll cause a lot of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.50,0:24:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And not just for me, but for\Neveryone in the palace, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I'm not telling you\Nhow to live your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.08,0:25:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd be going crazy if I was\Nstuck in one room for ten years.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.32,0:25:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.90,0:25:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my thanks for all that food!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.16,0:25:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So, where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.52,0:25:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.46,0:25:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.34,0:25:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.36,0:25:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's a foolish dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.90,0:25:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never forgive myself\Nfor doing something so selfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.60,0:25:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.80,0:25:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just standing here talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you apologizing for?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.42,0:25:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I can't stop crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.18,0:25:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just saying that took all of my courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.26,0:25:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't get angry and\Nstart yelling at me again!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.46,0:25:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really frightening when you do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.26,0:25:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a pain in the butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.16,0:25:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.96,0:25:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.28,0:25:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why now of all times?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.94,0:25:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Vander Decken must be behind this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.96,0:26:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's attacking the hard shell tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.32,0:26:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shura Hachi is in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.88,0:26:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how many guards are with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.28,0:26:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, all of the\Nguards are tied up here, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.18,0:26:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.44,0:26:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I need you to go check on the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.78,0:26:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, we have to do what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.28,0:26:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, King Deptune.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.48,0:26:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't possibly trust\Nthem with her safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there simply\Nisn't any other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.92,0:26:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The hard-shell tower is on the\Nnortheast side of the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.42,0:26:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you have to\Nhurry there immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.64,0:26:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not realize that as a hostage,\Nyou don't get to make demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.22,0:26:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.28,0:26:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi is the only daughter I have!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.28,0:26:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You may not realize, but her\Nlife is constantly under threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.66,0:26:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything should happen to\Nher while you occupy our home,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.78,0:26:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will send you all to your graves\Nat the bottom of an ocean trance!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.78,0:26:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how could I possibly\Nrefuse going to her rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.62,0:26:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall rush to her aid in this,\Nher greatest moment of need!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.52,0:26:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely selflessly, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No hint of an ulterior motive!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.10,0:27:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, if she wanted to show me\Nher panties, that would be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.66,0:27:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be a trap! No! This is awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.94,0:27:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one of them who's willing to\Nhelp us has the most impure of intentions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.26,0:27:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in worse danger now than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.50,0:27:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.94,0:27:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to untie me, but I\Ninsist that I accompany you, skeleton!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.98,0:27:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The tower is my jurisdiction!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.86,0:27:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to the princess, I\Nwill never be able to overcome my shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.38,0:27:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.78,0:27:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You desire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.94,0:27:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to burden you, but it truly\Nis my dream to go to the sea forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And these ten years, I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.96,0:27:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever I talk about making the trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.98,0:27:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone goes out of their way to tell me\Nhow dangerous it would be for me to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.08,0:28:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So I've never pushed the\Nissue because I'm too afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.74,0:28:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.34,0:28:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really willing to take me to the\Nsea forest despite the trouble you'll face?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.62,0:28:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.56,0:28:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And you promise to protect me\Nno matter what happens, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.50,0:28:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.04,0:28:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.62,0:28:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.96,0:28:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to do it if you keep crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.80,0:28:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I'm being honest here,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.96,0:28:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be the one taking me,\Nsince I can't swim and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.62,0:28:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, but that'll be\Nhard, because I'm so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.84,0:28:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything that\Ndoesn't make you cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.18,0:28:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, when we\Ngo to leave this place,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.54,0:28:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone's going to\Nrecognize you, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that'll be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.16,0:28:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it won't, because I've got the\Nperfect idea to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.60,0:28:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaid Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.52,0:28:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.80,0:28:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there at the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is worse than my greatest fear!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.36,0:29:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those weren't the sounds of\Naxes or knives like usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.36,0:29:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What we heard were the bodies of human\Npirates slamming against the tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.72,0:29:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How disgusting?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.14,0:29:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That Vanderdecken, he's\Nnothing short of a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.18,0:29:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we're in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.14,0:29:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.56,0:29:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It appears they all survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.36,0:29:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.66,0:29:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ryugu Palace is\Nsupposed to be impregnable,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.02,0:29:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,yet we've been invaded by enemy forces!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The king, the princess, everyone\Nhere, we're all in danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.60,0:29:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, it sounds like it finally stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.10,0:29:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You ready, scaredy-cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.90,0:29:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.16,0:29:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Megalos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.62,0:30:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Break through!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.92,0:30:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Megalo!
